				<pubDate>Sun, 23 Sep 2018 18:06:15 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>2303803</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This has a distinct Series I vibe without compromising tone. Good work.</p> <p>Also,</p> <blockquote> <p>Eventually, they will be filled with hydrogen gas generated by SCP-199, detach from the main plant, and drift into the air.</p> </blockquote> <p>Shouldn't this be &quot;Eventually, they will <strong>fill</strong> with hydrogen gas generated by SCP-199, detach from the main plant, and drift into the air&quot;? (will fill, will detach, will drift)</p> 
				 	]]>
