					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is a rewrite of a skip originally written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/misterflames" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=438028&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="MisterFlames" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=438028)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/misterflames" >MisterFlames</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photosynthetic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=361873&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="Photosynthetic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=361873)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photosynthetic" >Photosynthetic</a></span>.</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1173523&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="Eskobar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1173523)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eskobar" >Eskobar</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=414239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="Gabriel Jade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=414239)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-jade" >Gabriel Jade</a></span> for critique, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129691&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="Modern_Erasmus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129691)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" >Modern_Erasmus</a></span> for his help with rewriting in general.</p> <p>Edit: Changed the image, is from here now: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crepidomanes_minutum_utiwagoke01.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Crepidomanes_minutum_utiwagoke01.jpg</a></p> <p>Edit: I'd like to bring attention to a <a href="http://lafundacionscp.wikidot.com/scp-199">Spanish translation</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morhadow" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3535580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1542082463" alt="morhadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3535580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morhadow" >morhadow</a></span></p> 
